# Battle 71, flown by hand at Lieutenant (Plan 31 R5): one cruiser, which Delegate loses to (Plan 23: step 584).
# Battle stations and the weapons lock at once (full power, shields up, weapons charging, torpedoes homing). Then
# close in and hold the enemy off the starboard beam at 2000-3500, turning to keep it there; nearer, bear away, further
# off, turn in. Phasers and torpedoes are fired every few steps while they bear within 4500: the banks' charge is
# all a battle has (it never recharges), and a phaser does far more close in. It is destroyed near step 760; then the
# Bridge button leaves. Steering lines are the flight keys as held (yaw, pitch, roll, throttle); the throttle is a lever.
at 0 set power 4
at 0 set lock on
at 1 steer -1 1 0 1
at 45 steer -1 1 0 0
at 81 steer 0 1 0 0
